            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.23.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kuv 23:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni hagira uwo muri mwebge abona inka izimiye, cank’ intama, y’uw’ i wanyu w’Umwisirayeli, wewe uyibonye ntuz’ upfe kwirengagiza, arik’ uz’ uyigarurire inayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi inayo ni yakuba kure, cank’ ukaba utamuzi, uz’ uyijane i wawe, uyigumye, gushitsa aho inayo azoyironderera, uyimuhe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi n’indogoba uz’ uyigenze urtyo, bo n’impuzu itakaye, n’ikindi kintu cose c’uw’ i wanyu w’Umwisirayeli cari kizimiye, ukakirengukako: ntuz’ upfe kwirengagiza.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
