            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni hagira uwo muri mwebge abona icāri c’inyoni ku nzira imbere yiwe, kiri ku giti canke hasi, kirimw’ ivyana cank’ amagi, nyina ikaba ibundikiriye ivyo vyana cank’ amagi; wewe ubibonye, ntuz’ ufate nyina ng’ uyijanane n’ivyana vyayo: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.4.40"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Gus 4:40",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ntuz’ ubure kureka nyina ngw igende, arikw ivyana ushobora kubitwara; uz’ ureke nyina kugira ng’ ube mu vyiza, urambe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
